{"id":"874bd53a33f7d13e","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-nindependent.md","title":"Numerically Independent","display":"df-nindependent — Numerically Independent","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-nindependent","aliases":["58-df-ndependent","58-df-nindependent"],"display":"df-nindependent — Numerically Independent","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-nindependent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-ndependent</span><span>58-df-nindependent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nindependent — Numerically Independent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md\">../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S\\)</span> (cardinal-exponentiation function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e9a96ab954b6013e\" href=\"?note=e9a96ab954b6013e\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md\">../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NI}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{NI}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (numerically-independent-cardinal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nindependent} \\vdash \\mathrm{NI}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)\\neq\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nindependent} \\vdash \\mathrm{NI}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)\\neq\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The power of two is expressed by the actual upstream two-argument cardinal-exponentiation function.</li>\n<li>Numerically independent cardinals are not powers of two with a smaller cardinal exponent.</li>\n<li>Under GCH, every infinite successor cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^+\">\\(\\lambda^+\\)</span> fails this property because <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\">\\(2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+\\)</span>; limit cardinals are the natural candidates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md","status":"resolved","id":"e9a96ab954b6013e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardExp}_S$ (cardinal-exponentiation function, see [[../batch09/58-df-cardinal-exponentiation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NI}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nindependent} \\vdash \\mathrm{NI}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(2,\\lambda)\\neq\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda^+","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\lambda=\\lambda^+","display":false}],"bytes":1324,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-876","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-nindependent.md|58-df-nindependent]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","e9a96ab954b6013e","949691fe1747f59d"]}